{"version":1,"content":"<p>憑《正義迴廊》奪金像獎新晉導演的何爵天，今年轉戰電視，執導HOY處境劇《你的保安 李寶安》，意外成為電視台大戰一員。</p><p>面對資源緊絀、平均一天拍一集的壓力，加上電影業低潮，他仍以「好玩」的心態迎接挑戰，在不同崗位累積經驗，尋找創作的滿足感。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.619542+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:09:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:58:20.242083+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.351660+00:00","content_hash":"47537c37370336cf68f1c0898ef1ab362338d61deb5f5dd796e520dc6e4c6ebd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}